<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"So, what's it gonna be?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'd rather not, after all..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2">'s eyes I didn't meet as I gave that answer.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Then, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2">'s big sigh.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
"Okay, sorry. Yeah, of course not."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2">'s feelings, I wanted to live up to them, but I just couldn't bring myself to go outside.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Going out when a frightening incident like that is happening...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Let alone going to the scene of that incident. That's far too much for me.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"Well, never mind that, time to order pizza!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Instantly </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> changed her expression and went online.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> had apologized, but somehow I was the one who felt sorry.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, let's go after all. I'm feeling a lot better today."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, it's fine, it's fine! Forget that, right now it's pizza! <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, which one do you want?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> showed me the screen as if to brush it off.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Had I made her worry about my feelings again...?</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
